Very focused on getting CT + abx from GP: “My usual doctor would send me straight for a scan and some antibiotics… I can’t sit in Emergency all night.” Repeatedly asking if she could avoid ED.  

Meds (per pt, to match EMR):  
- Apixaban 5 mg bd (PE/DVT) – says not missing doses  
- Aspirin 100 mg daily  
- Atorvastatin 40 mg nocte  
- Bisoprolol 2.5 mg mane  
- Ramipril 5 mg daily  
- Mesalazine 800 mg tds (IBD). Recent pred course finished ~2/52 ago.  
NKDA.  

